1
00:00.050 --> 00:01.350 line:86%
Okay, bismillah.

2
00:01.450 --> 00:02.850 line:86%
Ready? Ready.

3
00:03.350 --> 00:05.150 line:86%
Do I need to double seat belt?

4
00:06.350 --> 00:07.650 line:86%
Okay, seat belt first…

5
00:07.700 --> 00:09.200 line:86%
So they asked me,

6
00:09.200 --> 00:11.000 line:86%
“I just want to ask you…”

7
00:11.500 --> 00:14.400 line:86%
“Your videographer, is he
from Chasing Vows?”

8
00:14.400 --> 00:15.900 line:86%
I was like, “Huh, why?”

9
00:16.000 --> 00:19.100 line:86%
“Because the video
is very similar.”

10
00:19.200 --> 00:20.700 line:86%
“Like Chasing Vows.
The vibe, man.”

11
00:20.800 --> 00:22.400 line:86%
So I said, “Oh, is it?”

12
00:22.500 --> 00:23.500 line:86%
“Nah, he's a freelancer.”

13
00:23.500 --> 00:25.900 line:86%
“He shoots now and then,
but he doesn't edit.”

14
00:26.700 --> 00:27.550 line:86%
“Oh, so who edits?”

15
00:27.600 --> 00:29.200 line:86%
“I edit lah.” “Oh, okay okay.”

16
00:29.300 --> 00:31.400 line:86%
Because the cut is very…
mysterious.

17
00:32.000 --> 00:33.300 line:86%
Then with your voiceover, right?

18
00:33.600 --> 00:36.700 line:86%
I told people, it's like
a drama. Serious!

19
00:37.300 --> 00:39.550 line:86%
Then that one shot
you came in at 85mm…

20
00:39.600 --> 00:40.800 line:86%
…from way back.

21
00:40.900 --> 00:42.400 line:86%
Wah, just nice. Like, the end.

22
00:42.500 --> 00:43.800 line:86%
The ending one, right?

23
00:44.000 --> 00:44.950 line:86%
That one's nice.

24
00:45.100 --> 00:46.500 line:86%
I don't mind the single cam.

25
00:46.600 --> 00:48.000 line:86%
But maybe next time…

26
00:48.000 --> 00:50.700 line:86%
…the single cam,
maybe a bit wider.

27
00:51.000 --> 00:52.900 line:86%
Because yours is too close up.

28
00:53.500 --> 00:54.750 line:86%
You have to go further lah.

29
00:54.800 --> 00:55.850 line:86%
Either you go further…

30
00:55.900 --> 00:58.450 line:86%
…or you get a mid shot.

31
00:58.500 --> 01:00.200 line:86%
Just take a mid shot.

32
01:00.700 --> 01:02.450 line:86%
Like that, it's too tight
for me to use.

33
01:02.500 --> 01:04.850 line:86%
And you were moving so much.

34
01:05.000 --> 01:07.000 line:86%
I just… didn't check the setting.

35
01:07.100 --> 01:09.300 line:86%
At first, I really thought…

36
01:09.500 --> 01:11.400 line:86%
“Eh, what's wrong
with my computer?”

37
01:11.800 --> 01:12.450 line:86%
“Why is everything slow?”

38
01:12.500 --> 01:14.750 line:86%
Right after the ring shot, right?

39
01:14.900 --> 01:15.900 line:86%
Right after the ring shot.

40
01:16.000 --> 01:18.000 line:86%
I was like… everything is slow.

41
01:18.100 --> 01:19.300 line:86%
And that slow-mo, right…

42
01:19.400 --> 01:21.400 line:86%
It's like super slow.
Crazy super slow!

43
01:21.550 --> 01:23.050 line:86%
That's why, my bad. I own it.

44
01:23.150 --> 01:23.700 line:86%
It's okay.

